Package: xios-native
Name: Xios Desktop (Native iPadOS)
Version: 0.1.2
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), xios-core (>= 0.1.4), xios-launcher-tools (>= 0.1.4), com.max.xiosprefs
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0.0
Description: the native iPadOS flavor for Xios
 Linux desktop apps as first-class iPadOS windows. There is no Linux shell
 in this flavor: each app gets its own home screen icon and its own iPadOS
 window, and Split View and Slide Over take the place of a desktop
 environment.
 .
 Installs the ioscd launch daemon and the per-app host that presents each
 app's window. App icons appear on the home screen next to your iOS apps;
 tap one and the app opens like any other iPad app.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.0 or newer. Target profile: @REPO_PROFILE@.
